DeployIdentityConfirmTest
├── when confirm runs on the local test chain
│   ├── it should revert
│   ├── it should name the chain in the unsupported chain error
│   └── it should publish no record
├── when confirm label runs on an unsupported chain
│   ├── it should revert
│   ├── it should name the chain in the unsupported chain error
│   └── it should publish no record
├── when the chain is unsupported and the label is invalid
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should raise the unsupported chain error first
└── when the chain is supported and the label is invalid
    ├── it should revert
    └── it should raise the invalid label error before reading the candidate
